speakers.bio:
Eugene Cheah is the CEO and co-founder of Featherless AI. Featherless runs a serverless inference platform serving over 40,000 open-source models at scale for startups to enterprises; 

Featherless AI's Series A was co-led by AMD Ventures and Airbus Ventures.

He has previously spoken for AIE in Singapore, and is an expert in inference and the challenges that come with it. Token usage has exploded, and we’re here to show how enterprises handle this. In one example, we helped a customer cut inference from ~$150K to ~$7.6K a month using open-source models.
